DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260702T220000
UID:62b0658ac3a2d7d30561b1840c4cc871@bossadc.com
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to present Jazz at Bossa: a collaboration with 
 JazzMob DC to showcase the diverse array of talented musicians in the Dist
 rict. The house trio consists of Elijah Jamal Balbed (sax)\, Andrew Mussel
 man (bass)\, and Paul Jung (percussion)\, and different guest artists join
  in each week.
LOCATION:Downstairs\, Bossa Bistro + Lounge\, 2463 18th Street NW\, Washin
 gton\, DC 20009
URL:https://bossadc.com/events/live-jazz-4/
X-SOURCE:Bossa Bistro + Lounge
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Latin Night feat. Verny Varela
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260702T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T003000
UID:651c3247bb4e79774eab2781902e508b@bossadc.com
DESCRIPTION:Verny Varela is an arranger\, composer\, singer and flutist wh
 o holds a bachelor's degree in music from the Universidad del Valle in Col
 ombia and an M.A. in Afro Hispanic Studies from Howard University. He perf
 orms at Bossa every first Thursday of the month. | Cost: $10 at the door
LOCATION:Downstairs\, Bossa Bistro + Lounge\, 2463 18th Street NW\, Washin
 gton\, DC 20009
URL:https://bossadc.com/events/verny-varela/
X-SOURCE:Bossa Bistro + Lounge
END:VEVENT
