DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260704T013000
UID:60f520ce503dd0f623b5545a92befeb4@bossadc.com
DESCRIPTION:Alfredo Mojica is a cornerstone of the DC salsa community. Bor
 n in Central America\, he is a consummate percussionist and vocalist who b
 egan performing at a tender age with such legends in the field as Celia Cr
 uz\, Eddie Palmieri\, Willie Colón\, Dizzy Gillespie\, Buddy Rich\, El Gr
 an Combo\, Ray Barretto... | Cost: $5-10 at the door
LOCATION:Downstairs\, Bossa Bistro + Lounge\, 2463 18th Street NW\, Washin
 gton\, DC 20009
URL:https://bossadc.com/events/alfredo-mojica-group/
X-SOURCE:Bossa Bistro + Lounge
END:VEVENT
